  "abstract": "This experiment builds on the new SOTA Fourier Forecaster (ID 331). Following my research program, this is Phase 2, which tests the hypothesis that adding LayerNorm to the predicted frequency-domain latent factors will stabilize training and further improve performance. This leverages the key finding from my \"Parsimony and Mastery\" study about the critical importance of normalization.",
